        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Traditional farmhouse in a lovely coastal location, in need of extensive renovation and repair. Located within walking distance of the wonderful Squince beach. \r\n\r\nSituated on c. 0.5 acres, the land is laid out in paddock and has an outbuilding which could be used for storage. \r\n\r\nSquince beach is a beautiful shingle beach where moorings are available. Reen pier, which is also nearby, is an ideal location for various types of marine activities. \r\n\r\nThe coastal village of Union Hall is c. 3 miles where there is a shop, restaurants and pubs. Skibbereen (Market Town) is just a 20-minute drive, where you can find a host of further public amenities such as banks, secondary schools & supermarkets etc.  \r\n\r\nBER: G\r\n\r\nTitle: Freehold"
